    "Literal snapshot preview and separate original-open guard retain exact hit/row/owner. Only type-equivalent includes to some identity membership change was necessary for union hit arrays.",
    "Existing full-value index refresh helper, sessions current-row assignment, and protected owner/ABA behavior remain unchanged."
